  "goodToKnow": "Die Ausgangssperre is a curfew. In April 2021, the federal Bundesnotbremse imposed a nighttime curfew from 10 pm to 5 am in districts with high COVID infection rates; the Federal Constitutional Court later upheld it. Officially, the more precise term was Ausgangsbeschränkung (restriction). Grounding a teenager is Hausarrest. Plural: die Ausgangssperren."
